{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/_research/agent-bus/research/arxiv-sweep/fulltext/1710.02950v2.txt", "equation": "\\displaystyle P\\big(\\tilde{u}\\big(\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\big(y^{i}-p^{i}\\big){\\bf z}^{i}\\big)\\leq r_{0}\\big)\n=\nP\n\n(\nmax\nj\n∈\n{\n1\n,\n…\n,\nb\n1\n}\n\n|\n∑\ni\n=\n1\nn\n(\ny\ni\n−\np\ni\n)\n\nz\nj\ni\n|\n≤\nr\n0\n)\n\\displaystyle=P(\\max_{j\\in\\{1,\\dots,b_{1}\\}}|\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\big(y^{i}-p^{i}\\big)z_{j}^{i}|\\leq r_{0})\n=\n1\n−\nP\n\n(\nmax\nj\n∈\n{\n1\n,\n…\n,\nb\n1\n}\n\n|\n∑\ni\n=\n1\nn\n(\ny\ni\n−\np\ni\n)\n\nz\nj\ni\n|\n>\nr\n0\n)\n\\displaystyle=1-P(\\max_{j\\in\\{1,\\dots,b_{1}\\}}|\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\big(y^{i}-p^{i}\\big)z_{j}^{i}|>r_{0})\n≥\n1\n−\n∑\nj\n=\n1\nb\n1\nP\n\n(\n|\n∑\ni\n=\n1\nn\n(\ny\ni\n−\np\ni\n)\n\nz\nj\ni\n|\n>\nr\n0\n)", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9403}
