{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/_research/agent-bus/research/arxiv-sweep/fulltext/1710.02950v2.txt", "equation": "\\leq\\exp\\big(-\\frac{3r_{0}^{2}}{D_{n}+2V_{n}}\\big),\nwhere\nD\nn\n=\n∑\ni\n=\n1\nn\n(\nmax\n\n{\n0\n,\nz\nj\ni\n}\n−\nmin\n\n{\n0\n,\nz\nj\ni\n}\n)\n2\n=\n∑\ni\n=\n1\nn\n(\nz\nj\ni\n)\n2\n=\nn\nD_{n}=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}\\big(\\max\\{0,z_{j}^{i}\\}-\\min\\{0,z_{j}^{i}\\}\\big)^{2}=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}(z_{j}^{i})^{2}=n\n, and\nV\nn\n=\n𝔼\nΛ\n∗\n\n(\nS\nn\n−\n𝔼\nΛ\n∗\n\nS\nn\n)\n2\n=\n∑\ni\n=\n1\nn\n(\nz\nj\ni\n)\n2\n\np\ni\n\n(\n1\n−\np\ni\n)\nV_{n}=\\mathbb{E}_{{{\\mathrm{\\Lambda}}^{*}}}(S_{n}-\\mathbb{E}_{{\\mathrm{\\Lambda}}^{*}}S_{n})^{2}=\\sum_{i=1}^{n}(z_{j}^{i})^{2}p^{i}(1-p^{i})", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9403}
